14. LEMP Application Hosting

Execution Steps
1.Launch Linux EC2 instance
2.Install Nginx, PHP, and MySQL
3.Configure Nginx server
4.Connect database with application
5.Restart Nginx service
6.Test application in browser

Project Overview
Hosted a high-performance LEMP stack application using Nginx.

AWS Services Used
Amazon EC2
Amazon RDS
Nginx
PHP
MySQL

Features
Faster web serving
Optimized architecture
Modern hosting stack

Architecture
Nginx + PHP → MySQL Database
